WEBVTT

01:33.160 --> 01:36.080
NO-RETAKE ACCOUNTING ALLIANCE

01:36.160 --> 01:37.480
FENG XILUN, IS THIS YOUR MASTER?

01:37.560 --> 01:38.400
HAHA

01:38.480 --> 01:40.360
DIDN'T SEE THAT COMING. ROMANTIC, NO?

01:43.760 --> 01:45.040
It has to be him. I mean it!

01:45.120 --> 01:46.240
No doubt about it.

01:46.320 --> 01:47.920
No problem. I'll send it to you.

01:48.520 --> 01:49.520
There's more.

01:49.600 --> 01:50.680
Send it to me too.

01:52.280 --> 01:53.640
Right?

01:53.720 --> 01:55.360
I didn't think he would be…

01:57.120 --> 01:58.280
What's the matter?

01:59.320 --> 02:00.720
-What are you guys watching?
-Go.

02:00.800 --> 02:01.720
Let's go.

02:02.560 --> 02:03.400
Nothing.

02:04.000 --> 02:04.840
Xilun.

02:06.200 --> 02:07.040
Master.

02:08.360 --> 02:09.240
Hand it over.

02:09.720 --> 02:10.840
What?

02:10.919 --> 02:12.040
The phone.

02:19.960 --> 02:21.320
NANPING FUNERAL PARLOR

05:10.600 --> 05:15.080
ADAPTED FROM THE ORIGINAL WORK
"LOVER" BY SHE MU SI

05:18.640 --> 05:22.280
SHANGHAI

05:31.480 --> 05:34.160
MR. HE: JIE, ARE YOU THERE YET?
IS EVERYTHING OKAY?

05:34.240 --> 05:35.760
I just got here, Mr. He.

05:35.840 --> 05:37.240
You and Mom don't have to worry.

05:44.360 --> 05:45.960
TAKE CARE OF YOURSELF.

05:46.040 --> 05:48.120
TELL US IF YOU'RE DATING.
YOUR MOM AND I WILL BE HAPPY.

05:52.280 --> 05:54.400
Gosh. Where did that come from?

06:06.560 --> 06:08.040
You're home, my darling!

06:11.240 --> 06:12.600
Drama queen.

06:12.680 --> 06:13.520
I just took a break.

06:14.080 --> 06:15.280
I missed you.

06:15.360 --> 06:17.080
I couldn't sleep while you were gone.

06:18.160 --> 06:19.080
As if.

06:19.160 --> 06:20.680
I bet you were partying every night.

06:24.040 --> 06:24.880
What do we have here?

06:24.960 --> 06:26.280
Is it cheat day?

06:27.560 --> 06:29.440
You accomplished such a huge feat.

06:29.520 --> 06:31.360
What's a few calories?

06:31.440 --> 06:33.240
Here you go, Ms. Zhuang.

06:37.040 --> 06:38.560
Let me wash my hands first.

06:38.640 --> 06:39.480
I shall savor

06:39.560 --> 06:41.360
your taste in takeout in a bit.

06:42.120 --> 06:44.080
We have to get a good drink tonight.

06:44.160 --> 06:45.040
After that,

06:45.120 --> 06:47.120
you're going to spill everything.

06:48.600 --> 06:50.240
All I did was sell some yams.

06:50.320 --> 06:51.680
Why are you making a fuss too?

06:51.760 --> 06:53.760
Who said anything about yams?

06:53.840 --> 06:55.560
I meant what went down
at the train station.

06:55.640 --> 06:56.800
Don't play dumb.

06:58.680 --> 07:00.360
The train station?

07:01.120 --> 07:02.400
How did you know about that?

07:03.320 --> 07:04.600
The whole town probably knows

07:04.680 --> 07:05.760
by now.

07:09.520 --> 07:10.400
Let me see that.

07:10.480 --> 07:11.600
What is it? Let me see.

07:11.680 --> 07:13.080
Let me see.

07:13.160 --> 07:14.160
Okay. Stop.

07:14.240 --> 07:15.160
You can have it.

07:16.920 --> 07:18.360
Where did this come from?

07:19.080 --> 07:20.360
There's even a video.

07:21.560 --> 07:23.000
Getting steamy, aren't we?

07:23.080 --> 07:24.280
Who recorded this?

07:25.640 --> 07:27.120
Who is this?

07:27.760 --> 07:29.240
Who filmed this?

07:29.920 --> 07:33.360
You were in Nanping, not Shanghai, miss.

07:33.440 --> 07:34.760
At the train station,

07:34.840 --> 07:36.560
there is bound to be someone
who knows you.

07:36.640 --> 07:38.560
Never mind the fact
that it's Chen Maidong,

07:38.640 --> 07:40.200
who works in public service.

07:40.280 --> 07:41.720
More people are bound to know him.

07:41.800 --> 07:43.240
Doing that there was serving gossip

07:43.320 --> 07:45.160
to everyone on a silver platter.

07:46.120 --> 07:48.000
I bet someone posted it on social media

07:48.080 --> 07:49.520
while you two were busy locking lips.

07:49.600 --> 07:50.800
In less than ten minutes,

07:50.880 --> 07:53.040
it spread
to all community and alumni groups.

07:55.960 --> 07:58.120
No wonder Mr. He sent me that text.

07:58.200 --> 08:00.040
But he's tight-lipped.
He won't say a thing.

08:00.120 --> 08:01.280
As for my mom…

08:01.360 --> 08:03.560
My mom doesn't really use WeChat.

08:03.640 --> 08:04.520
He Niaoniao.

08:04.600 --> 08:06.200
He Niaoniao had her phone confiscated.

08:06.280 --> 08:08.320
Thank goodness.
The house isn't going to blow up.

08:08.400 --> 08:10.560
So now you worry.

08:10.640 --> 08:12.320
What were you guys doing,

08:12.400 --> 08:15.160
kissing for so long in a public space?

08:16.040 --> 08:18.240
Trying to reenact a Korean drama?

08:18.320 --> 08:20.240
Stop teasing me.

08:21.400 --> 08:24.080
Chen Maidong must be freaking out by now.

08:39.679 --> 08:40.720
COPY

08:43.760 --> 08:46.480
A FREE-SPIRITED WOMAN

09:06.120 --> 09:07.120
OLD CEDAR

09:24.480 --> 09:26.440
At this point,
why are you still denying it?

09:26.520 --> 09:27.920
Just come clean about it.

09:28.000 --> 09:29.200
But we didn't get together.

09:32.080 --> 09:33.000
I…

09:34.520 --> 09:35.440
I kissed Chen Maidong

09:36.560 --> 09:38.040
in the heat of the moment.

09:39.680 --> 09:41.640
You kissed him?

09:41.720 --> 09:43.160
By force?

09:46.800 --> 09:49.680
I was reckless just this once in my life.

09:49.760 --> 09:51.560
How did it end up
becoming a town spectacle?

09:57.600 --> 09:58.960
Zhuang Jie!

09:59.520 --> 10:00.400
You…

10:00.480 --> 10:01.960
What is he going to do?

10:07.800 --> 10:08.680
Master.

10:08.760 --> 10:09.760
Knock first.

10:16.840 --> 10:18.400
Master, are you off duty?

10:19.760 --> 10:20.840
Out with it.

10:20.920 --> 10:23.040
I just want to talk
to you about something.

10:23.120 --> 10:25.400
Today, the town committee
brought over an elderly widow.

10:25.480 --> 10:27.360
She passed away in her nap.
It was peaceful.

10:27.440 --> 10:29.760
But we can't reach her family.

10:29.840 --> 10:30.680
What should we do?

10:30.760 --> 10:31.880
Today's tasks must be done.

10:32.760 --> 10:34.480
But it's my mom's birthday today.

10:39.600 --> 10:40.600
I'll cover for you.

10:40.680 --> 10:41.640
Really?

10:41.720 --> 10:42.600
Go home.

10:42.680 --> 10:43.920
Thanks, Master.

10:44.000 --> 10:45.440
Your kindness will be repaid.

10:50.520 --> 10:52.640
-Master?
-What's your problem?

10:52.720 --> 10:54.760
I just wanted to let you know.

10:54.840 --> 10:55.680
In the future,

10:55.760 --> 10:58.240
if you decide to elope
or go on a honeymoon or something,

10:58.320 --> 11:00.120
I'll cover all your shifts for you.

11:00.200 --> 11:02.080
I promise you two won't be disturbed.

11:02.640 --> 11:03.600
No complaints!

11:16.720 --> 11:19.080
Grandma, I have to work late tonight.

11:19.160 --> 11:21.000
Rest early.

11:21.640 --> 11:23.040
Don't be nosy.

12:11.800 --> 12:12.800
Hello.

12:14.120 --> 12:15.360
My name is Chen Maidong.

12:16.400 --> 12:17.240
What's your name?

12:22.680 --> 12:24.040
Is she your maternal grandma

12:24.120 --> 12:25.000
or paternal grandma?

12:25.640 --> 12:26.800
Paternal grandma.

12:28.560 --> 12:31.000
Did you sneak in here to be with her?

12:33.720 --> 12:36.280
But this is where I work.

12:36.360 --> 12:37.640
No outsiders are allowed.

12:38.400 --> 12:39.240
Do you understand?

12:39.320 --> 12:42.200
Mister, I want to go home with Grandma.

12:42.280 --> 12:44.080
Can you wake her up?

12:45.000 --> 12:46.800
I won't make Grandma angry anymore.

12:46.880 --> 12:48.680
I won't ask her for Mommy and Daddy.

12:48.760 --> 12:50.280
I won't do it anymore.

12:54.560 --> 12:55.960
Let's go outside first, shall we?

12:56.760 --> 12:57.840
It's cold in here.

13:01.440 --> 13:02.440
I can't go.

13:04.360 --> 13:06.360
I have to make Grandma not angry with me.

13:08.920 --> 13:11.360
I used to brush her hair

13:11.440 --> 13:12.920
when she got mad at me.

13:13.000 --> 13:14.880
That always cheered her up.

13:20.400 --> 13:21.600
Your grandma…

13:25.280 --> 13:26.560
isn't mad at you.

13:27.320 --> 13:29.080
She is.

13:29.160 --> 13:31.560
I've been begging her to wake up,
but she just won't.

13:31.640 --> 13:33.480
Grandma has never been like this.

13:36.160 --> 13:37.560
Your grandma is just tired.

13:39.120 --> 13:40.120
She needs rest.

13:41.000 --> 13:42.040
I'll stay with you.

13:47.160 --> 13:51.120
Mister, don't forget to ask Grandma
what I did wrong.

13:51.200 --> 13:52.720
I'll change.

13:52.800 --> 13:54.520
I don't want her to leave me.

13:56.680 --> 13:59.520
I don't want her to leave
like Mummy and Daddy did. Please?

14:11.640 --> 14:13.560
Your grandma

14:14.400 --> 14:15.720
would never do that.

14:20.560 --> 14:21.880
She will always,

14:23.400 --> 14:24.640
always love you.

14:40.520 --> 14:42.880
Is it really impossible
for you and Chen Maidong?

14:47.400 --> 14:49.040
His grandma needs him.

14:50.200 --> 14:51.600
The town also needs him.

14:53.000 --> 14:54.800
He can't leave just like that.

14:55.400 --> 14:56.360
And what about you?

14:56.920 --> 14:58.960
Are you going to stay in Shanghai forever?

15:01.960 --> 15:04.560
I just love Shanghai so much.

15:06.920 --> 15:08.040
I love the streets here.

15:08.120 --> 15:09.560
Hengshan Road.

15:09.640 --> 15:10.640
Fumin Road.

15:10.720 --> 15:12.080
Wukang Road.

15:12.160 --> 15:13.760
I love the bridges too.

15:14.280 --> 15:15.360
Yangpu.

15:15.440 --> 15:16.920
Nanpu. Donghai.

15:18.280 --> 15:19.560
And I love the buildings here.

15:26.360 --> 15:27.920
Maybe what we love

15:28.000 --> 15:29.280
more than Shanghai itself

15:29.360 --> 15:30.640
is who we are here.

15:33.360 --> 15:34.440
Especially me.

15:36.720 --> 15:37.840
For someone

15:37.920 --> 15:38.880
who once had to measure

15:38.960 --> 15:40.240
the world with crutches,

15:41.040 --> 15:43.400
it's a miracle that I managed

15:43.480 --> 15:44.880
to put down roots here.

15:47.720 --> 15:49.400
When I walk the streets of Shanghai,

15:50.640 --> 15:52.320
no one notices my leg.

15:53.280 --> 15:54.640
When I cross each bridge,

15:54.720 --> 15:57.000
no one cares how my dad died.

15:59.640 --> 16:00.720
Here,

16:01.400 --> 16:02.960
as long as you're good enough,

16:03.040 --> 16:05.640
anyone can live in a high-rise and gaze

16:05.720 --> 16:07.840
at the towering Oriental Pearl Tower.

16:08.920 --> 16:10.480
Sometimes, I even feel

16:10.560 --> 16:13.600
everyone's shrewdness and indifference
aren't flaws.

16:14.600 --> 16:17.280
Everyone is racing, trying to get ahead

16:17.360 --> 16:19.280
and win the rewards.

16:19.920 --> 16:21.240
The rules are clear.

16:26.280 --> 16:28.440
It's just a shame for Chen Maidong.

16:28.520 --> 16:30.280
He can't compete with a whole city.

16:35.760 --> 16:37.400
I do like Chen Maidong a lot.

16:39.080 --> 16:40.280
I always have.

16:42.320 --> 16:45.240
But I love Shanghai and myself even more.

17:14.599 --> 17:15.839
But you know what?

17:16.480 --> 17:18.480
At least you kissed Chen Maidong,

17:18.560 --> 17:19.880
and he kissed you back.

17:20.680 --> 17:22.480
Shanghai might not return your feelings.

17:22.560 --> 17:24.240
It's such an alluring city.

17:24.319 --> 17:25.720
It takes everyone's love for it.

17:26.720 --> 17:29.560
Take those newbies in the company,
for example.

17:29.640 --> 17:32.640
All of them have a master's degree
or higher and are full of vitality.

17:32.720 --> 17:34.600
It's really hard to keep up with them.

17:35.200 --> 17:36.520
Sometimes when I see them,

17:36.600 --> 17:38.720
I feel a sense of crisis
about getting old.

17:38.800 --> 17:41.680
Lately, I've even developed insomnia.

17:43.200 --> 17:44.960
Let's save up

17:45.040 --> 17:46.400
and then start our own business

17:46.480 --> 17:47.480
like our former boss did

17:47.560 --> 17:48.560
and show them who's boss.

17:48.640 --> 17:50.480
Thanks for the encouragement.

17:51.640 --> 17:52.680
As someone with insomnia,

17:52.760 --> 17:54.560
I should go to bed now.

17:54.640 --> 17:56.200
But let me give you one last reminder.

17:56.280 --> 17:59.400
Your reputation in Nanping is in shambles.

18:00.040 --> 18:01.440
Consider plastic surgery.

18:02.480 --> 18:03.440
I know.

18:04.320 --> 18:05.960
I let it get the better of me.

18:06.040 --> 18:07.200
I kissed Chen Maidong.

18:07.280 --> 18:08.280
No regrets.

18:09.520 --> 18:10.560
All right.

18:10.640 --> 18:11.600
Good night.

18:33.640 --> 18:34.680
ZHUANG JIE

18:35.880 --> 18:38.360
I'VE ARRIVED SAFELY IN SHANGHAI.
SORRY ABOUT WHAT HAPPENED TODAY.

18:40.280 --> 18:42.880
GREAT MAN

19:07.680 --> 19:11.440
A FREE-SPIRITED WOMAN

19:13.320 --> 19:17.000
I'VE ARRIVED.
CHEN MAIDONG, SORRY ABOUT TODAY.

19:33.800 --> 19:35.560
DELETE CONTACT

19:44.800 --> 19:49.360
CHEN MAIDONG, DID I CAUSE YOU
TROUBLE TODAY? ARE YOU OKAY?

19:49.440 --> 19:50.600
YOU ARE NOT THIS USER'S FRIEND

19:57.800 --> 20:00.040
SEND A FRIEND REQUEST TO CHAT

20:02.400 --> 20:03.480
Come on.

20:41.360 --> 20:44.400
HONOR CERTIFICATE AWARDED

20:49.880 --> 20:51.040
WOMEN'S DOUBLES, SECOND PLACE

20:54.040 --> 20:56.080
STRIVE FOR EXCELLENCE

20:56.160 --> 20:57.760
GRANDMA'S TO-DO LIST

20:57.840 --> 20:59.640
VARIOUS PASSWORDS

20:59.720 --> 21:01.560
GRANDMA'S, PLEASE REMEMBER

21:16.200 --> 21:17.640
What is all this for?

21:17.720 --> 21:19.120
For you, dear Grandma.

21:20.160 --> 21:21.880
Come on, Grandma. Let's eat.

21:25.720 --> 21:27.600
When my grandson makes breakfast,

21:28.200 --> 21:29.800
there must be something good.

21:35.200 --> 21:37.040
My grandson does everything so well.

21:37.120 --> 21:38.520
He's even better than me.

21:42.600 --> 21:44.040
Sunny-side up?

21:44.120 --> 21:46.320
I can never get it right.

21:51.640 --> 21:53.280
The last time you made sunny-side up eggs

21:54.280 --> 21:55.440
was to tell me

21:55.520 --> 21:57.640
you broke up with Song Yi.

21:58.480 --> 21:59.600
It was just a coincidence.

22:00.160 --> 22:01.520
You're not fooling me.

22:01.600 --> 22:02.960
Sunny-side up eggs

22:03.880 --> 22:05.000
are never a good sign.

22:06.280 --> 22:07.640
Isn't it good news for you

22:07.720 --> 22:09.600
that I broke up with Song Yi?

22:09.680 --> 22:12.560
It's not good news for me
no matter who you break up with.

22:16.240 --> 22:17.280
Grandma,

22:18.680 --> 22:20.920
you've been worrying about me
all these years.

22:22.320 --> 22:23.880
Even though I haven't said it,

22:24.560 --> 22:26.520
it doesn't mean I don't appreciate it.

22:27.160 --> 22:28.240
Brats.

22:29.360 --> 22:30.680
This must be bad news.

22:31.600 --> 22:32.600
Grandma,

22:33.480 --> 22:35.160
I'm already grown up.

22:35.240 --> 22:36.880
You should have basic trust in me.

22:36.960 --> 22:38.000
There you go.

22:38.480 --> 22:40.960
The more you set the stage,
the worse it is going to be.

22:41.680 --> 22:42.760
Just say it.

22:44.080 --> 22:45.280
I can take it.

22:48.080 --> 22:49.320
I'm cutting off Zhuang Jie.

22:50.320 --> 22:51.640
We won't meet again.

22:52.560 --> 22:54.560
Didn't you two just…

22:55.520 --> 22:57.440
I lost my senses
in a moment of impulsiveness.

22:57.520 --> 22:59.400
You can't say that.

22:59.480 --> 23:01.360
Everyone knows what you two did.

23:01.440 --> 23:02.920
Let them say what they want.

23:03.000 --> 23:04.080
I don't care.

23:04.160 --> 23:05.360
You…

23:05.440 --> 23:07.000
Aren't you going to consider Jie at all?

23:07.080 --> 23:08.920
She's a girl!

23:09.000 --> 23:10.800
She's in Shanghai.

23:10.880 --> 23:13.280
Who knows when she will come back again?

23:13.960 --> 23:15.480
These rumors

23:15.560 --> 23:16.880
will blow over soon enough.

23:17.560 --> 23:20.040
How did I end up raising such a rascal?

23:22.960 --> 23:24.120
Forget it.

23:24.200 --> 23:25.920
From now on,
I won't care about you anymore.

23:33.840 --> 23:35.560
If you don't care about me, then who will?

23:37.280 --> 23:39.160
Do you want to be like my parents?

23:40.360 --> 23:42.360
I still want to live longer.

23:43.200 --> 23:45.040
You, ungrateful child,

23:45.840 --> 23:47.400
will die alone and lonely.

23:48.960 --> 23:49.960
Grandma,

23:51.240 --> 23:52.640
I promise

23:52.720 --> 23:54.400
I won't upset you again.

23:55.040 --> 23:56.000
You have the final say

23:56.080 --> 23:57.480
in my matchmaking matters.

23:58.160 --> 23:59.680
I'll marry

23:59.760 --> 24:00.960
whomever you like.

24:02.640 --> 24:03.760
Except for Zhuang Jie.

24:05.240 --> 24:07.120
What's wrong with Zhuang Jie?

24:07.200 --> 24:08.280
Nothing.

24:09.200 --> 24:10.600
I'm the one who isn't good for her.

24:11.200 --> 24:12.680
We can never seem

24:13.760 --> 24:14.840
to talk peacefully.

24:14.920 --> 24:16.160
We always lock horns.

24:17.160 --> 24:18.440
I don't know why.

24:19.000 --> 24:20.560
Isn't this how family behaves?

24:20.640 --> 24:22.560
You don't talk nicely to me either.

24:22.640 --> 24:23.560
Grandma,

24:24.840 --> 24:25.880
let me be honest.

24:28.800 --> 24:30.560
Zhuang Jie doesn't like me
that much either.

24:32.040 --> 24:34.000
She wouldn't come back to Nanping for me.

24:35.680 --> 24:37.200
You act like matchmaking

24:37.880 --> 24:39.680
is the end of the world.

24:42.400 --> 24:43.400
Chen Maidong,

24:44.520 --> 24:46.200
I'm an old woman.

24:47.120 --> 24:49.320
I can't be with you forever.

24:50.720 --> 24:52.520
Sooner or later,
you'll have to start a family.

24:56.080 --> 24:57.040
As you say.

25:00.480 --> 25:01.360
Let's eat.

25:02.040 --> 25:04.520
I'll find Wu Xuehua later.

25:06.720 --> 25:08.280
I really like

25:10.000 --> 25:11.160
Jie.

25:16.400 --> 25:18.880
She's a girl worth more than gold.

25:21.120 --> 25:22.560
Oh well.

25:22.640 --> 25:24.640
It's not meant to be.

25:37.760 --> 25:43.440
ENTRANCE TO TAIXIN HEALTHCARE

25:43.520 --> 25:45.120
Zhuang Jie, you're back to work.

25:45.200 --> 25:46.120
We've been bored

25:46.200 --> 25:47.720
without you.

25:48.400 --> 25:50.240
I ordered too much. Have some.

25:51.560 --> 25:53.400
What goodies do we have?
I'll take some too.

25:53.480 --> 25:54.360
You don't get any.

25:54.440 --> 25:56.840
Every time you fail
to lose weight, you blame me.

25:57.480 --> 25:58.920
Well, I only eat your goodies.

25:59.000 --> 26:01.760
That reminds me.
The other day I was talking about you.

26:01.840 --> 26:04.240
If you take a longer leave,

26:04.320 --> 26:06.840
someone will snatch up
your respiratory pump order.

26:06.920 --> 26:07.760
That's right.

26:07.840 --> 26:09.520
That new employee in your company, Jia,

26:09.600 --> 26:11.160
is always going to the Equipment Dept.

26:11.240 --> 26:12.920
She's helping me
maintain client relations.

26:13.000 --> 26:14.800
Sure. You're so trusting.

26:14.880 --> 26:16.240
All right.

26:16.320 --> 26:17.680
I'll go to the Equipment Dept. now

26:17.760 --> 26:19.960
so you guys don't worry.

26:20.040 --> 26:22.120
Zhuang Jie is the one
who gets things done.

26:22.200 --> 26:24.280
If you ask me, Jia doesn't stand a chance.

26:25.760 --> 26:27.480
Can't you find out what is wrong?

26:28.080 --> 26:29.800
This is the second time this month.

26:30.600 --> 26:32.560
What are those after-sales people
even doing?

26:33.160 --> 26:35.680
-What's wrong, Jia?
-If it's not fixed this afternoon…

26:35.760 --> 26:37.760
Ms. Zhuang, you're finally back.

26:37.840 --> 26:40.040
The boss asked me to help you follow up.

26:40.120 --> 26:41.760
I'm just a small fry. I can't handle it.

26:41.840 --> 26:43.080
It's just a follow-up.

26:43.160 --> 26:45.120
No need for you to handle anything, right?

26:45.200 --> 26:46.800
You're right.

26:47.360 --> 26:49.000
I just don't like conflicts.

26:49.080 --> 26:51.040
-How is that possible?
-Director Liu always yells.

26:51.120 --> 26:53.160
-He scares me. Listen.
-Tell them!

26:53.240 --> 26:55.200
-I never eavesdrop.
-Tell them I said it!

27:00.040 --> 27:01.680
What did Qin do

27:01.760 --> 27:03.360
to make the good-tempered Director Liu

27:03.440 --> 27:05.000
lose his cool and start cursing?

27:05.080 --> 27:06.640
Spare me the sarcasm.

27:06.720 --> 27:07.560
Me? Good-tempered?

27:07.640 --> 27:09.320
You really are angry.

27:12.280 --> 27:13.880
I'm telling you, Zhuang Jie,

27:13.960 --> 27:15.880
it doesn't matter
how well-informed you are.

27:15.960 --> 27:17.840
I'm not changing
the respiratory pumps yet.

27:17.920 --> 27:19.520
No need to keep sending them one by one.

27:19.600 --> 27:22.240
I know. They still have
at least six months in them.

27:22.320 --> 27:23.280
I'm aware of that.

27:23.360 --> 27:24.520
Six months?

27:24.600 --> 27:26.960
In another half a month, I'll be a goner.

27:27.040 --> 27:28.080
Well, you've got me.

27:28.160 --> 27:29.920
Although they're not our machines,

27:30.000 --> 27:31.480
the technical parameters are the same.

27:31.560 --> 27:32.680
Give me the problem feedback.

27:32.760 --> 27:34.800
I'll call a meeting with our engineers.

27:34.880 --> 27:36.520
Wait here. I'll go get it.

27:37.480 --> 27:38.880
You salespeople never do anything

27:38.960 --> 27:40.080
unless it's for profit.

27:40.160 --> 27:41.400
I know.

27:41.480 --> 27:44.760
If you solve the pump problem,

27:44.840 --> 27:46.440
I'll order my next batch of monitors

27:46.520 --> 27:47.480
from you.

27:47.560 --> 27:50.560
Director Liu, that's not fair.

27:50.640 --> 27:53.000
I've been with Taixin Healthcare
for so long.

27:53.080 --> 27:55.680
When have I ever
taken advantage of someone's weakness?

27:55.760 --> 27:57.200
We only provide the best equipment,

27:57.280 --> 27:59.240
technical support,
and high-quality service.

27:59.320 --> 28:00.960
That's where my confidence comes from.

28:01.040 --> 28:03.320
We have a code of ethics in sales, okay?

28:03.400 --> 28:04.880
Okay, I can't argue with you.

28:04.960 --> 28:06.560
Just do your thing.

28:06.640 --> 28:07.680
-Hurry up.
-Here.

28:10.240 --> 28:11.840
All right. Leave it to me.

28:17.040 --> 28:19.800
Jia, contact the technical specialist
for the respiratory pump.

28:19.880 --> 28:22.080
Set up a conference call in 15 minutes.
You're included.

28:22.160 --> 28:23.120
Yes, Ms. Zhuang.

28:41.640 --> 28:42.560
Mrs. Chen.

28:42.640 --> 28:44.040
Here, have some water.

28:44.120 --> 28:45.080
Thank you.

28:48.920 --> 28:51.240
Don't worry.
I've made all the arrangements.

28:51.320 --> 28:53.320
I'm glad that Maidong will go
on the blind dates.

28:53.400 --> 28:54.720
Thank you, Wu.

28:55.760 --> 28:56.960
Mrs. Chen,

28:57.040 --> 28:58.400
why don't we go inside?

28:58.480 --> 28:59.920
The sun is scorching.

29:00.000 --> 29:02.240
We don't want you to get a sunburn.

29:02.320 --> 29:03.240
I'm fine.

29:04.680 --> 29:06.520
I want to stay here for a bit.

29:06.600 --> 29:08.360
Wu, don't worry.

29:08.440 --> 29:09.960
I won't cause you any more trouble.

29:10.760 --> 29:12.080
Here, have an orange.

29:12.160 --> 29:13.040
Thank you.

29:19.920 --> 29:21.000
Remember.

29:22.000 --> 29:24.200
Whenever it is work
that involves the elderly

29:24.280 --> 29:26.200
and the left-behind children,

29:26.280 --> 29:27.720
you must be especially meticulous.

29:27.800 --> 29:30.320
-Got it.
-It will be your responsibility.

29:31.520 --> 29:33.600
Is he that Chen Maidong?

29:36.160 --> 29:37.000
Pay attention.

29:37.080 --> 29:38.960
Did you hear what I just said?

29:39.040 --> 29:40.360
Yes, Madam Wu.

29:40.440 --> 29:42.440
It's him, right? The train station.

29:45.040 --> 29:46.080
It's me.

29:46.160 --> 29:47.160
Is there a problem?

29:55.520 --> 29:56.400
All right.

29:57.360 --> 29:58.360
Madam Wu,

29:59.080 --> 30:00.800
have arrangements been made for the boy?

30:01.800 --> 30:04.360
He has already been sent
to his aunt's house in the city.

30:04.440 --> 30:06.680
I heard his aunt and uncle are good folks,

30:06.760 --> 30:08.760
much better than his parents.

30:08.840 --> 30:09.960
They're simply inhuman.

30:10.760 --> 30:12.480
Okay. I should go. I'll get busy.

30:12.560 --> 30:13.400
Maidong.

30:13.480 --> 30:14.440
Come here.

30:16.760 --> 30:19.680
Your grandma came to me again
the other day.

30:21.080 --> 30:21.960
About the matchmaking?

30:22.040 --> 30:23.120
Yes.

30:24.000 --> 30:26.000
The old lady worries too much.

30:26.080 --> 30:28.120
She must not know
about you and Zhuang Jie.

30:28.200 --> 30:29.280
There's nothing between us.

30:33.480 --> 30:35.640
I'm glad I didn't mention it to anyone,

30:35.720 --> 30:38.080
not even Zhuang Jie's mother.

30:38.160 --> 30:40.440
After all,
it's you young people's business.

30:41.440 --> 30:42.640
Regarding the arranged dates,

30:43.240 --> 30:44.320
I'll do as my grandma wants.

30:44.920 --> 30:46.200
I'll be troubling you, Madam Wu.

30:47.120 --> 30:48.800
So are you really going to do it?

30:49.640 --> 30:50.600
Yes.

30:51.320 --> 30:52.760
You make the arrangements. I'll go.

30:53.360 --> 30:54.920
-I'm going back to work.
-Okay.

31:01.840 --> 31:03.400
He said yes to the arranged dates.

31:05.000 --> 31:07.880
Say, what is with these young people?

31:08.520 --> 31:09.880
Do they think this is all a game?

31:10.960 --> 31:12.040
Madam Wu.

31:13.480 --> 31:15.760
Do you think I can do it?

31:16.360 --> 31:18.240
For what?

31:19.160 --> 31:20.760
As a marriage candidate for Chen Maidong.

31:21.560 --> 31:22.920
You…

31:23.000 --> 31:24.760
He pulled that stunt at the train station

31:24.840 --> 31:26.040
and you still want him?

31:26.680 --> 31:28.680
No, you don't understand.

31:28.760 --> 31:29.840
Everyone is saying

31:29.920 --> 31:31.720
they either never dated or they broke up.

31:31.800 --> 31:34.080
As long as it's a clean break, it's fine.

31:34.160 --> 31:37.120
People are more valuable
when more people like them.

31:37.680 --> 31:39.440
The photos they took of him at the station

31:39.520 --> 31:40.840
look like they're from a magazine.

31:40.920 --> 31:43.080
I even saved them. Do you want to see?

31:43.160 --> 31:44.240
Let me stop you right there.

31:44.320 --> 31:45.880
How old do you think you are?

31:45.960 --> 31:48.440
Can you please focus on your work instead?

31:49.200 --> 31:50.720
You've lost your mind.

31:55.000 --> 31:57.360
No wonder so many girls
have been asking me

31:57.440 --> 31:59.600
about Chen Maidong recently.

32:00.840 --> 32:03.160
What's wrong with these girls?

32:03.240 --> 32:05.800
Madam Wu!

34:41.719 --> 34:42.600
Yes?

34:43.400 --> 34:45.120
Got it. I'll be right there.

35:41.240 --> 35:45.800
THREE MONTHS LATER

35:48.760 --> 35:50.320
What's the matter with you?

35:50.800 --> 35:52.160
The girl already said

35:52.240 --> 35:53.760
she doesn't mind your job

35:53.840 --> 35:55.120
at the funeral parlor

35:55.200 --> 35:57.680
and doesn't insist
on buying a house in the city.

35:57.760 --> 35:59.680
And she doesn't care about your past!

36:00.240 --> 36:01.440
What more do you want?

36:02.240 --> 36:03.440
What do you want?

36:03.520 --> 36:04.880
I get sleepy whenever she talks.

36:04.960 --> 36:06.160
I can't help it.

36:06.240 --> 36:08.480
Who doesn't make you feel sleepy
when they talk?

36:08.560 --> 36:10.680
You tell me!

36:10.760 --> 36:11.800
Okay.

36:11.880 --> 36:12.840
Let's take a break.

36:12.920 --> 36:13.920
Don't tire yourself out.

36:16.240 --> 36:17.680
What's the rush?

36:17.760 --> 36:19.120
I'll just keep seeing other girls.

36:19.760 --> 36:20.800
Don't fool me.

36:20.880 --> 36:22.640
You eliminated half the lot
from their photos.

36:22.720 --> 36:24.520
After meeting in person,
you aren't interested.

36:24.600 --> 36:26.040
-Tell me.
-Wait.

36:26.120 --> 36:27.520
I have a call.

36:29.960 --> 36:30.800
Hello?

36:35.760 --> 36:37.520
Got it. I'll be right there.

36:37.600 --> 36:38.880
Is something wrong?

36:38.960 --> 36:41.160
A major accident at the industrial plant.
I have to go.

36:41.240 --> 36:42.800
Go on, then. Get going.

36:46.720 --> 36:48.800
I wonder whose family
has been affected this time.

36:50.040 --> 36:51.680
TAIXIN HEALTHCARE

36:51.760 --> 36:52.800
Have some water.

36:52.880 --> 36:54.880
-Thanks, Director Liu.
-Qin went to get the contract.

36:55.680 --> 36:58.280
Zhuang Jie, this isn't just flattery,

36:58.360 --> 37:00.360
but you are a woman
with foresight and magnanimity.

37:00.440 --> 37:02.400
You always bring Jia along
no matter what you do.

37:02.480 --> 37:04.240
I thought she was the wave

37:04.320 --> 37:06.760
that was going to wipe you out.

37:08.360 --> 37:10.000
Everyone starts out as a rookie.

37:10.080 --> 37:11.440
We all need guidance.

37:11.520 --> 37:12.480
I have ways to go.

37:12.560 --> 37:14.040
I have much to learn from Ms. Zhuang.

37:15.440 --> 37:18.000
Anyway,
with this batch of monitors, Zhuang Jie,

37:18.080 --> 37:19.920
I'll be honest.

37:20.000 --> 37:21.800
I need you
to keep your eyes peeled for me.

37:21.880 --> 37:23.080
I pre-ordered in advance

37:23.160 --> 37:25.960
because I trust your professionalism.

37:27.000 --> 37:28.400
Rest assured, Director Liu.

37:31.040 --> 37:32.000
It's my sister.

37:32.080 --> 37:33.320
She hardly ever calls me. I…

37:33.400 --> 37:34.240
Go ahead.

37:39.240 --> 37:41.200
Hello, Niaoniao. What is it?

37:43.040 --> 37:44.960
Calm down. Take your time.

37:45.720 --> 37:46.600
What happened?

37:50.440 --> 37:51.520
I understand.

37:52.640 --> 37:53.600
I'll be there.

38:04.560 --> 38:05.520
Director Liu,

38:05.600 --> 38:06.640
I'm so sorry.

38:06.720 --> 38:08.280
Something came up at home.

38:08.360 --> 38:09.720
I have to go. I…

38:10.480 --> 38:11.680
Zhuang Jie, the contract.

38:23.680 --> 38:25.480
Sir, to the train station.
Please drive fast.

38:28.920 --> 38:30.200
Dead on arrival at the hospital.

38:30.280 --> 38:31.600
They sent him straight to us.

38:33.560 --> 38:34.760
Blunt force trauma to the face?

38:34.840 --> 38:36.640
Yes. They just finished
a factory renovation.

38:36.720 --> 38:38.120
They had relatives and friends come

38:38.200 --> 38:40.560
to help move large production equipment
into the building.

38:40.640 --> 38:42.800
Somehow it tipped over
and crushed two people.

38:42.880 --> 38:44.360
The other person got lucky.

38:44.440 --> 38:45.960
No life-threatening injuries.

38:46.040 --> 38:47.520
What's the name of the deceased?

38:48.120 --> 38:50.680
Surname He. He Zhangyue.

38:50.760 --> 38:51.920
From Liaogen Braised Chicken.

38:53.520 --> 38:54.560
Zhuang Jie's stepfather.

39:08.320 --> 39:11.040
SHANGHAI SOUTH RAILWAY STATION

39:44.160 --> 39:46.120
MR. HE HAD AN ACCIDENT. COME HOME.

39:46.200 --> 39:47.520
COME TO THE HOSPITAL. HURRY.

39:47.600 --> 39:48.680
COME TO THE FUNERAL PARLOR

42:26.920 --> 42:33.600
ALL ANIMALS IN THIS PROGRAM
WERE TREATED KINDLY
